    "response": "{\"decision\":\"established_flaw\",\"issues\":[{\"category\":\"contextual_flattening\",\"target_kind\":\"assertion\",\"claim_quote\":\"The displayed sources show that policy debate is mainly driven by institutional procedures and formal paperwork.\",\"evidence\":[{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_fb6f93bc4795bf8a\",\"quote\":\"I am grateful to the right hon. Gentleman for giving way, because there is a party here that does not agree with the consensus that appears to be building up. Today’s Budget will go down as a pivotal moment in the dismantling of the welfare state, with the Government’s own advisers saying that slashing the benefits cap will throw 40,000 more children into poverty. Can he say...\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_83204f62569f9cc2\",\"quote\":\"I just do not agree with that, I am afraid. We have set out to protect disability living allowance and PIPs...\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_a9c8552735818533\",\"quote\":\"In my first speech to the House as a Member of Parliament, I said that I wanted to be able to speak on behalf of those whose voices were small and might not be heard. In this debate, I want to speak up on behalf of the women who are detained at the Yarl’s Wood removal centre...\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_748ed8d3ac29d84a\",\"quote\":\"9. Residents in the rural parts of my constituency, such as Affetside and Holcolme, which after all are just a few miles from Manchester city centre, are 100% unconnected to superfast broadband. ...\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_a9c8552735818533\",\"quote\":\"It is almost beyond question that the current process of immigration detention is costly, ineffective and too often unjust for too many of the people involved. ...\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_a9c8552735818533\",\"quote\":\"How on earth can I justify to my taxpayers the expenditure of £100 a night to incarcerate someone in a prison, only then to put them back where they came from in the first place? ...\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_a9c8552735818533\",\"quote\":\"How can the Minister defend a policy that results in 50% of the people who are put into detention centres being put straight back into the community rather than being removed? ...\"},{\"excerpt_id\":\"EXC_a9c8552735818533\",\"quote\":\"Why on earth will he not take the advice of the all-party parliamentary groups and look into the proposed alternative case management systems, which would offer a lower-cost solution for the taxpayer? ...\"}],\"whole_packet_no_support\":\"absence of a consequential countercase\",\"mechanism\":\"The sources present a range of perspectives on policy, including economic, social, and individual concerns, rather than solely institutional procedures.\",\"material_consequence\":\"The claim ignores the significant human impact and diverse motivations driving policy debate, presenting an incomplete picture.\",\"counterconditions\":\"The cited excerpts demonstrate a wide range of concerns beyond institutional procedures, including poverty, welfare, human rights, and service delivery.\"}],\"unresolved\":[],\"rationale\":\"The claim oversimplifies the drivers of policy debate by focusing exclusively on institutional procedures, neglecting the substantial human and societal factors highlighted across the provided sources. The evidence reveals a complex landscape of concerns that extend far beyond formal processes.\"}",
    "done": true,
    "done_reason": "stop",
